{%- liquid
  assign is_fr = false
  if request.locale.iso_code contains 'fr'
    assign is_fr = true
  endif

  comment
    Les reseaux sociaux sont lus depuis les reglages du theme (Social profiles),
    partages avec les donnees structurees Organization. Les reglages de section
    restent acceptes en surcharge pour ne pas casser une config existante.
  endcomment
  assign instagram_url = section.settings.instagram | default: settings.social_instagram_url
  assign facebook_url = section.settings.facebook | default: settings.social_facebook_url
  assign tiktok_url = section.settings.tiktok | default: settings.social_tiktok_url
  assign youtube_url = section.settings.youtube | default: settings.social_youtube_url
  assign pinterest_url = settings.social_pinterest_url
  assign linkedin_url = settings.social_linkedin_url

  comment
    Le logo du pied de page reprend celui des reglages du theme (Theme
    settings > Logo, aujourd'hui LOGO_ANTARED.jpg) ; le reglage de section
    ci-dessous ne sert qu'a le surcharger.

    Le fichier est un JPEG a fond blanc : pose tel quel sur le fond sombre du
    pied de page il afficherait un rectangle blanc. Il est donc rendu dans une
    pastille claire (.site-footer__logo), qui reste correcte si une version
    transparente est televersee plus tard. Ne pas tenter de le detourer avec
    un filter: invert() — le rouge de la marque virerait au cyan.
  endcomment
  assign footer_logo = section.settings.logo | default: settings.logo
-%}

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="site-footer__top">
      <div class="site-footer__brand">
        {%- if footer_logo != blank -%}
          <a class="site-footer__logo" href="{{ routes.root_url }}" aria-label="Antared">
            <img src="{{ footer_logo | image_url: width: 360 }}"
                 width="180" height="{{ 180 | divided_by: footer_logo.aspect_ratio | round }}"
                 alt="Antared" loading="lazy">
          </a>
        {%- else -%}
          <h3>ANTARED</h3>
        {%- endif -%}
        <p>{% if is_fr %}Technologies bien-&ecirc;tre inspir&eacute;es par la science pour accompagner le sommeil, la r&eacute;cup&eacute;ration et l'&eacute;clat de la peau.{% else %}{{ section.settings.tagline | default: "Science-backed wellness technologies to enhance sleep, recovery, and beauty." }}{% endif %}</p>
        <div class="site-footer__socials">
          {% if instagram_url != blank %}<a href="{{ instagram_url }}" rel="me noopener" target="_blank" aria-label="Instagram">{% render 'icon', name: 'instagram' %}</a>{% endif %}
          {% if facebook_url != blank %}<a href="{{ facebook_url }}" rel="me noopener" target="_blank" aria-label="Facebook">{% render 'icon', name: 'facebook' %}</a>{% endif %}
          {% if tiktok_url != blank %}<a href="{{ tiktok_url }}" rel="me noopener" target="_blank" aria-label="TikTok">{% render 'icon', name: 'tiktok' %}</a>{% endif %}
          {% if youtube_url != blank %}<a href="{{ youtube_url }}" rel="me noopener" target="_blank" aria-label="YouTube">{% render 'icon', name: 'youtube' %}</a>{% endif %}
          {% if pinterest_url != blank %}<a href="{{ pinterest_url }}" rel="me noopener" target="_blank" aria-label="Pinterest">{% render 'icon', name: 'pinterest' %}</a>{% endif %}
          {% if linkedin_url != blank %}<a href="{{ linkedin_url }}" rel="me noopener" target="_blank" aria-label="LinkedIn">{% render 'icon', name: 'linkedin' %}</a>{% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>

      {% for block in section.blocks %}
        {% if block.type == 'menu_column' %}
          {%- assign column_links = linklists[block.settings.menu].links -%}
          {%- if column_links.size > 0 -%}
            <div class="site-footer__col" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
              <h4>{{ block.settings.heading | escape }}</h4>
              <ul>
                {% for link in column_links %}
                  <li><a href="{{ link.url }}">{{ link.title }}</a></li>
                {% endfor %}
              </ul>
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}
        {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}

      {%- comment -%}
        La colonne legale generee depuis shop.policies a ete retiree : le menu
        Shopify "footer-legal" la couvre desormais, et les deux affichaient les
        memes politiques cote a cote. Les liens de ce menu doivent donc rester
        alignes sur les politiques reellement redigees dans Settings > Policies
        — rien ici ne le verifie plus automatiquement.
      {%- endcomment -%}
    </div>

    {%- if shop.enabled_payment_types.size > 0 -%}
      <div class="site-footer__payments" aria-label="{% if is_fr %}Moyens de paiement accept&eacute;s{% else %}Accepted payment methods{% endif %}">
        {%- for type in shop.enabled_payment_types -%}
          {{ type | payment_type_svg_tag: class: 'site-footer__payment-icon' }}
        {%- endfor -%}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

    <div class="site-footer__bottom">
      <span>&copy; {{ 'now' | date: "%Y" }} Antared. {% if is_fr %}Tous droits r&eacute;serv&eacute;s.{% else %}All rights reserved.{% endif %}</span>
      <span>{{ shop.address.country }} &middot; {{ cart.currency.iso_code }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Footer",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "logo", "label": "Footer logo (overrides Theme settings > Logo)" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "tagline", "label": "Tagline" },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Social links now live in Theme settings > Social profiles, so the footer icons and the Organization structured data stay in sync. The four fields below only override them."
    },
    { "type": "url", "id": "instagram", "label": "Instagram URL (override)" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "facebook", "label": "Facebook URL (override)" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "tiktok", "label": "TikTok URL (override)" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "youtube", "label": "YouTube URL (override)" }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "menu_column",
      "name": "Menu column",
      "settings": [
        { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Shop" },
        { "type": "link_list", "id": "menu", "label": "Menu", "default": "footer" }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "max_blocks": 7,
  "default": {
    "blocks": [
      { "type": "menu_column", "settings": { "heading": "Shop", "menu": "footer-shop" } },
      { "type": "menu_column", "settings": { "heading": "Discover", "menu": "footer-discover" } },
      { "type": "menu_column", "settings": { "heading": "Learn", "menu": "footer-learn" } },
      { "type": "menu_column", "settings": { "heading": "Professionals", "menu": "footer-professionals" } },
      { "type": "menu_column", "settings": { "heading": "Support", "menu": "footer-support" } },
      { "type": "menu_column", "settings": { "heading": "Company", "menu": "footer-company" } },
      { "type": "menu_column", "settings": { "heading": "Legal", "menu": "footer-legal" } }
    ]
  }
}
{% endschema %}
